":"burst","why":"Wukong dives and bursts"}],"yin":[{"answer":"healing","why":"Yin heals from the kit"},{"answer":"physical","why":"Yin deals physical damage"},{"answer":"burst","why":"Yin dives and bursts"}],"yurei":[{"answer":"healing","why":"Yurei heals from the kit"},{"answer":"physical","why":"Yurei deals physical damage"},{"answer":"burst","why":"Yurei dives and bursts"}],"zarus":[{"answer":"healing","why":"Zarus heals from the kit"},{"answer":"physical","why":"Zarus deals physical damage"},{"answer":"burst","why":"Zarus dives and bursts"}],"zinx":[{"answer":"healing","why":"Zinx heals from the kit"},{"answer":"magic","why":"Zinx deals magical damage"}]},"heroTips":{"adele":{"playAgainst":"sidestep Imperial Lash, since without it she has to walk in; once Queen's Garden is down she has no big lockdown, and walking out of the Thornbush limits its damage and slow; tenacity helps against her chained root and Mesmerize","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Imperial Lash","types":["root"],"sec":0.6},{"ability":"Royal Flourish","types":["sleep"],"sec":1},{"ability":"Queen’s Garden","types":["disable","root","pull"],"sec":0.5}]},"akeron":{"playAgainst":"dodge Web Lash and watch for him lashing to walls before the leap stun; stay out of the Consume cone while he is slowed pulling, and avoid long trades once he is Awakened; buy anti-heal for his Crushing Maw and Consume healing","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Web Lash","types":["root","knockup","stun"],"sec":1},{"ability":"Consume","types":["pull"],"sec":null}]},"argus":{"playAgainst":"dodge Dread Nova, his only stun; dive him during the Synaptic Obliterator channel when he is immobile, and keep health high since beams hit harder on missing health; magic armor blunts his damage","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Dread Nova","types":["stun"],"sec":1.2},{"ability":"Ether Crystal","types":["knockback","pull"],"sec":null}]},"aurora":{"playAgainst":"do not walk into the Hoarfrost ring while it persists; Cryoseism slows before it stuns, so cleanse or tenacity help, and spread so the explosion does not chain; she is weak once Glacial Charge is down","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Hoarfrost","types":["root"],"sec":1.2},{"ability":"Cryoseism","types":["stun"],"sec":1}]},"bayle":{"playAgainst":"dodge the horizontal third slash of Cursed Edge and sidestep the Kingslayer dash during its slowed charge-up; burst him through Berserk or disengage until it ends; anti-heal cuts Dire Howl healing and armor helps against his physical damage","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Cursed Edge","types":["knockup","stun"],"sec":0.65},{"ability":"Kingslayer","types":["knockup"],"sec":null}]},"boris":{"playAgainst":"Ursine Burst hovers briefly before the dash, so sidestep it or stay behind your frontline; back off from Primeval Roar until it explodes to avoid the fear; fight after Detection Protocol is spent; anti-heal trims his Canister healing","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Primeval Roar","types":["fear"],"sec":1},{"ability":"Ursine Burst","types":["pull"],"sec":null}]},"countess":{"playAgainst":"Feast is her engage, so peel or punish after it is spent; note where her Shadow was left, since she can swap back to it; magic armor and anti-heal blunt her Blade Siphon and Feast healing","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Feast","types":["suppress"],"sec":0.75}]},"crunch":{"playAgainst":"fight after Forward Crunch is used, since it is his long-cooldown gap closer; respect his second ability cast because the next one is Turbo-enhanced; anti-heal blunts Re-Crunch healing and armor helps against his physical damage","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Forward Crunch","types":["stun","knockback"],"sec":0.25},{"ability":"Right Crunch","types":["knockup","stun"],"sec":0.75}]},"dekker":{"playAgainst":"dodge Stasis Bomb, whose stun gets longer the farther it travels; step out of the Ion Strike center during its delay; stay out of the fence ring or flank around it; tenacity shortens her stuns","powerSpike":"early","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Stasis Bomb","types":["stun"],"sec":1.6},{"ability":"Ion Strike","types":["stun"],"sec":1.5}]},"drongo":{"playAgainst":"dodge Gag Grenade's silence; Shrapnel Cannon cast in the air launches him away and is briefly unstoppable, so engage after it is used; armor blunts his physical damage","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Gag Grenade","types":["silence"],"sec":1.2},{"ability":"Shrapnel Cannon","types":["knockback"],"sec":null}]},"eden":{"playAgainst":"disengage to let her Heat decay before she Overheats; punish melee stance after Talon Drive is spent, and buy anti-heal against her melee stance healing; armor blunts her physical damage","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[]},"feng-mao":{"playAgainst":"bait Safeguard's Spellshield before committing your key CC; back off when low, since Earth Shatter executes and recasts on a kill; armor counters his physical damage","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[]},"gadget":{"playAgainst":"do not walk through Security Gate; leave Tesla Dome early since it grows larger; with no mobility in the kit, dive Gadget after the gate is used; magic armor helps","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Security Gate","types":["root"],"sec":1}]},"gideon":{"playAgainst":"dodge Void Breach and Cosmic Rift; Torn Space is his only escape, so dive him after it is used; walk out of Black Hole early since it drags slowly; magic armor blunts his burst","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Black Hole","types":["pull"],"sec":null},{"ability":"Cosmic Power","types":["root"],"sec":1}]},"greystone":{"playAgainst":"Do not burst into Stone Forged Soul's Stasis; step away from the slow and the crash, then re-engage. Open with an ability since Stoicism deflects a basic, and buy anti-heal to cut the ult heal.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[]},"grim-exe":{"playAgainst":"Bait Energy Shield with a cheap ability, then land your real CC. GTFO is blocked by enemy heroes, so a teammate can body-block it for a low target; dive him while he is slowed channeling it.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Displacement Blast","types":["knockback"],"sec":null}]},"grux":{"playAgainst":"Stampede has a delay before the charge and Smash 'n Grab channels before the shockwave, so sidestep both. Fight after he spends them, and buy anti-heal against Double Pain's heal.","powerSpike":"early","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Smash 'n Grab","types":["pull","stun"],"sec":0.75},{"ability":"Stampede","types":["pull"],"sec":null},{"ability":"Warlord's Challenge","types":["stun"],"sec":0.75}]},"howitzer":{"playAgainst":"Walk around grenades and get out of Land Mine's blast before it goes off. He can blast himself away with Land Mine, so engage after it is used; magical armor helps against his burst.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Land Mine","types":["knockback","stun"],"sec":0.5}]},"iggy-scorch":{"playAgainst":"Do not fight in his oil and fire; flank around it. Melee basics break Flame Turrets quickly, and turrets go inactive when he moves away from them, so drag the fight off them; magical armor helps.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Inferno","types":["knockback"],"sec":null}]},"ikra":{"playAgainst":"Narcosis stops on the first hero it hits, so a tanky teammate can block it for a carry. Leave a bubble's radius before it amplifies, and fight after Narcosis is down; magical armor helps.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Narcosis","types":["knockup"],"sec":1.1},{"ability":"Genesis","types":["knockup"],"sec":null}]},"kaelen":{"playAgainst":"Step off Rimeglass so Frostbite ends before Winter's Pursuit can root you. Frostfall channels before he leaps, so move out of the center of the landing and leave the Rimestorm; tenacity helps against the roots.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Rimefang","types":["stun"],"sec":0.2},{"ability":"Winter's Pursuit","types":["root"],"sec":1.2},{"ability":"Frostfall","types":["root"],"sec":1.5}]},"kallari":{"playAgainst":"Ward and stay near teammates since nearby heroes and wards reveal Camouflage. Guillotine has a brief delay before the dash, so CC her during it or after Shadow Dance; stay healthy since her damage grows on low targets.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[]},"khaimera":{"playAgainst":"Buy anti-heal to cut Invigorate and Rage regen. Save your CC until after Invigorate is used since it cleanses, and break off for a few seconds so his Rage decays.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Cull","types":["suppress"],"sec":1.25}]},"kira":{"playAgainst":"During Purge she cannot attack or cast anything but Shadow Glide and is slowed, so CC her then. Avoid feeding takedowns since they reset Shadow Glide, and expect Purge's anti-heal.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[]},"kwang":{"playAgainst":"Watch where the Blade lands: it tethers, Surge into it knocks up, and Fury teleports him to it. Move away from the Blade and fight after Surge is used.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Surge of the Heavens","types":["knockup","stun"],"sec":0.25}]},"legion":{"playAgainst":"Stun him while he cooks Frag Order to make him drop it. Bait Rally Point's knockback before engaging, trade when he reloads, and buy anti-heal against Rally Point's heal and armor against his physical damage.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Frag Order","types":["knockup"],"sec":null},{"ability":"Rally Point","types":["knockback"],"sec":null}]},"lt-belica":{"playAgainst":"Seismic Assault erupts after a short delay, so sidestep the line. Avoid casting near Void Drone since it zaps and drains mana, and dive her after Seismic Assault is used; magical armor helps.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Seismic Assault","types":["stun","knockup"],"sec":1.4},{"ability":"Neural Disruptor","types":["silence"],"sec":0.5}]},"maco":{"playAgainst":"Hit him to remove Mach Speed! stacks. Maco Sparkle! is slow-moving and stuns longest at range, so sidestep it or close the distance; dodge the charged Strike! line.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Maco Sparkle!","types":["stun"],"sec":1.2},{"ability":"Maco Strike!","types":["knockback","stun"],"sec":1.4}]},"morigesh":{"playAgainst":"Dodge Hive, since its slow sets up everything else, and trade when Swarm is down because it is her damage reduction, speed and main heal. Anti-heal cuts the healing from Mark and Swarm.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[]},"mourn":{"playAgainst":"Abduct and Beguile are both visible channels that slow Mourn, so sidestep the vines and walk out of the growing Beguile radius before it erupts. Anti-heal blunts Contagion and Extract.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Abduct","types":["pull"],"sec":null},{"ability":"Beguile","types":["sleep"],"sec":1.2}]},"murdock":{"playAgainst":"Avoid fighting over Static Traps and engage after Buckshot is used, since it is his push-back peel. Stay out of the ult line at low health; armor does not help against Long Arm of the Law.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Buckshot","types":["knockback"],"sec":null},{"ability":"Static Trap","types":["root"],"sec":1.25}]},"muriel":{"playAgainst":"Watch for the charging Serenity bolt and step out of its line before it reaches max charge. When Reversal of Fortune is down she cannot join distant fights, so pick off her side lanes then.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Serenity","types":["stun"],"sec":1.2},{"ability":"Reversal Of Fortune","types":["knockup"],"sec":0.5}]},"narbash":{"playAgainst":"Sidestep the small Thunk area, and walk out of Crash Bang Boom! early since he slows himself while channeling and it only Mesmerizes at max stacks. Spread out so Mosh Pit gives him fewer stacks.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Thunk","types":["knockback","stun"],"sec":1.3},{"ability":"Crash Bang Boom!","types":["sleep","knockup","stun"],"sec":0.5}]},"neon":{"playAgainst":"Watch her Thread count and respect the next ability when she is at 3, since Overclocked Data Burst Mesmerizes. Dodge the lobbed Data Burst before it detonates, and engage after Erase Vector is spent, which is her only dash. Magic armor helps but L.I.N.X return and pulse are true damage.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Data Burst","types":["sleep"],"sec":null}]},"phase":{"playAgainst":"Turn away from Psychic Flare, since it only blinds enemies facing it, and break Energy Lance's beam before it reaches the root. Anti-heal cuts the shared healing; focus the linked carry or force the Link out of range.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Psychic Flare","types":["blind"],"sec":1.2},{"ability":"Energy Lance","types":["root"],"sec":1.2}]},"rampage":{"playAgainst":"Dodge the thrown boulder and watch for him carrying one before a Pounce. Anti-heal cuts his regeneration and Behemoth healing, and kiting him out of Behemoth's duration wastes it.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"mid","cc":[{"ability":"Pounce","types":["knockback"],"sec":null},{"ability":"Boulder Throw","types":["stun"],"sec":1.4}]},"renna":{"playAgainst":"Watch for the 1.5s Abyssal Rift channel and leave the target area, and dodge the Stupor orb after she rises. Anti-heal cuts Mortal Coil healing; trade early before she stacks Essence.","powerSpike":"mid","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"Mortal Coil","types":["pull"],"sec":null},{"ability":"Stupor","types":["sleep"],"sec":1.2}]},"revenant":{"playAgainst":"Dodge the Scar orb, since it sets up the root and focuses Obliterate. Do not get caught alone when Reckoning is up; armor helps against his physical damage.","powerSpike":"late","scaling":"late","cc":[{"ability":"